WEBVTT

00:00:03.030 --> 00:00:05.540
I'm fourteen-year-old Hoshizora Miyuki.

00:00:06.170 --> 00:00:08.530
The Big Bad Wolf attacked me again

00:00:08.540 --> 00:00:12.080
while I was being a Precure.  I was in big trouble!

00:00:13.910 --> 00:00:19.150
And that's when my classmate, Akane-chan, transformed into a Precure, too!

00:00:20.950 --> 00:00:23.390
When we're together, it's double the happiness!

00:00:23.390 --> 00:00:25.740
Where could the third Precure be?

00:00:29.980 --> 00:00:31.550
Smile! Smile! Smile! Smile!

00:00:31.550 --> 00:00:33.390
Smile Precure!

00:00:33.690 --> 00:00:34.290
Let's go!

00:00:34.290 --> 00:00:35.820
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:00:35.820 --> 00:00:36.960
All together!

00:00:37.190 --> 00:00:38.560
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:00:38.560 --> 00:00:40.760
Jump to tomorrow!

00:00:40.930 --> 00:00:43.430
Smile Precure!

00:00:45.300 --> 00:00:48.270
Smile! Smile! Smile Precure!

00:00:48.540 --> 00:00:53.710
A smile, shining like the sun.

00:00:54.080 --> 00:00:58.910
We all carry an undying sparkle.

00:00:59.650 --> 00:01:04.850
Keep going with all you've got, girls!

00:01:05.220 --> 00:01:09.790
Those beads of sweat are diamonds.

00:01:09.190 --> 00:01:09.760
So bright!

00:01:09.790 --> 00:01:14.960
The future that you'll shine the way to

00:01:15.330 --> 00:01:21.400
When you five lights seize the will to win.

00:01:19.370 --> 00:01:21.900
Happy! Sunny! Peace! March! Beauty!

00:01:22.440 --> 00:01:23.070
Let's go!

00:01:23.070 --> 00:01:25.770
(Smile! Smile!) The power of a smile

00:01:25.770 --> 00:01:28.710
(Smile! Smile!) Joins us all together.

00:01:29.040 --> 00:01:33.510
We'll never let a friend cry!

00:01:32.880 --> 00:01:34.080
Girls! Let's go!

00:01:34.150 --> 00:01:35.750
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:01:35.750 --> 00:01:36.880
Everybody!

00:01:36.920 --> 00:01:38.550
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:01:38.550 --> 00:01:41.090
Fly to the future!

00:01:41.420 --> 00:01:44.590
Sparkle! Smile Precure!

00:01:45.360 --> 00:01:46.760
Smile! Smile! Smile! Smile!

00:01:46.760 --> 00:01:49.060
Smile Precure!

00:01:52.610 --> 00:01:55.780
Your mom's omelettes are the best!

00:01:55.780 --> 00:01:57.150
I'll tell her that!

00:01:57.150 --> 00:01:58.110
Now, then…

00:01:58.480 --> 00:02:01.780
If I put this rose Décor into the Smile Pact…

00:02:01.790 --> 00:02:04.120
Let's go! Roses!

00:02:08.920 --> 00:02:10.820
These smell nice-kuru!

00:02:11.340 --> 00:02:13.460
They're very refreshing, aren't they?

00:02:13.460 --> 00:02:16.100
The Cure Décor can do stuff like that, too?

00:02:16.440 --> 00:02:20.040
The Cure Décor are treasures that will save Märchenland-kuru.

00:02:20.380 --> 00:02:21.600
Akane-kun!

00:02:21.600 --> 00:02:25.060
Getting ahold of the Cure Décor is our mission as Precure!

00:02:25.320 --> 00:02:28.640
Becoming a Precure one day before me has gone to your head, hasn't it?

00:02:29.770 --> 00:02:32.980
Anyway, apparently there are five Precure in total.

00:02:33.850 --> 00:02:35.580
Let's find them together!

00:02:35.580 --> 00:02:36.890
Kuru, kuru!

00:02:37.100 --> 00:02:39.460
Alright! You can depend on me!

00:02:52.800 --> 00:02:54.700
That's amazing, Kise-san!

00:02:56.180 --> 00:02:57.700
Don't look!

00:02:57.700 --> 00:02:59.140
That's really good!

00:03:00.930 --> 00:03:02.180
Y-You mean it?

00:03:02.510 --> 00:03:03.540
No joke.

00:03:03.540 --> 00:03:05.310
Are they characters you made up yourself?

00:03:06.530 --> 00:03:09.660
I like drawing pictures like this.

00:03:09.660 --> 00:03:11.250
But I guess it's a bit childish of me.

00:03:12.440 --> 00:03:13.770
Not at all!

00:03:13.770 --> 00:03:16.080
I love picture books, myself!

00:03:16.080 --> 00:03:19.600
I never knew you had this kind of talent!

00:03:19.600 --> 00:03:22.240
You should show everyone in class!

00:03:23.290 --> 00:03:24.930
Th-That would be embarrassing!

00:03:24.930 --> 00:03:26.640
They'll only make fun of me, anyway.

00:03:26.640 --> 00:03:29.380
Don't tell anyone about this, alright, guys?

00:03:47.580 --> 00:03:48.960
Those Precure!

00:03:48.960 --> 00:03:51.830
What a waste of my time!

00:03:55.590 --> 00:03:57.700
Can you keep the noise down, Akaoni?

00:03:57.700 --> 00:04:00.270
I've finished working on my iron club-oni!

00:04:01.310 --> 00:04:03.050
You're totally useless,

00:04:03.050 --> 00:04:05.060
so I'm taking the initiative-oni.

00:04:15.100 --> 00:04:16.620
Quiet, everyone!

00:04:17.020 --> 00:04:21.130
There's not much time left before the Clean School Grounds Week poster competition.

00:04:21.130 --> 00:04:23.590
Is there anyone who'll draw the poster for our class?

00:04:25.270 --> 00:04:26.890
Who cares who does it?

00:04:26.890 --> 00:04:28.620
You do it, then!

00:04:28.620 --> 00:04:29.700
No way!

00:04:31.340 --> 00:04:33.900
If we don't decide today, it won't get done in time.

00:04:33.900 --> 00:04:35.970
How about some nominations?

00:04:39.180 --> 00:04:40.580
Yes! Yes!

00:04:40.580 --> 00:04:42.300
Yes, Hoshizora-san.

00:04:43.540 --> 00:04:45.630
I think Kise-san would do a good job!

00:04:48.730 --> 00:04:50.300
I think so, too!

00:04:52.520 --> 00:04:54.520
Are there any other suggestions?

00:04:57.490 --> 00:04:58.470
Kise-san,

00:04:58.470 --> 00:05:00.350
would you do it for us?

00:05:06.070 --> 00:05:06.870
Yes!

00:05:06.870 --> 00:05:09.010
Okay, then we'll leave it in Kise-san's hands.

00:05:15.210 --> 00:05:17.020
It's so funny, you know!

00:05:17.020 --> 00:05:18.180
Really?

00:05:18.380 --> 00:05:21.650
Hoshizora-san, why did you nominate me?

00:05:21.650 --> 00:05:22.760
Why not?

00:05:22.760 --> 00:05:24.600
You're good at drawing, aren't you?

00:05:24.600 --> 00:05:27.160
I'm dead sure you'd win!

00:05:27.160 --> 00:05:30.590
You wouldn't say that if you knew the real situation.

00:05:34.030 --> 00:05:35.540
Art…

00:05:35.540 --> 00:05:37.430
…goes kaboom!

00:05:39.550 --> 00:05:41.700
Soga-kun is president of the art club.

00:05:41.700 --> 00:05:44.770
He's a genius who's won the contest before.

00:05:47.010 --> 00:05:48.310
As for Mikawa-san,

00:05:48.310 --> 00:05:52.410
she's the school's talent when it comes to drawing girls' manga.

00:05:53.880 --> 00:05:55.120
Then there's Narushima-kun.

00:05:55.530 --> 00:05:58.020
He's really popular for making girls look beautiful in portraits.

00:05:58.020 --> 00:06:01.000
You're making Mariko look so cute!

00:06:01.000 --> 00:06:02.030
Oh, how wonderful!

00:06:02.030 --> 00:06:03.730
Draw me, too, Narushima-kun!

00:06:03.730 --> 00:06:06.360
That sure is some close competition.

00:06:06.530 --> 00:06:08.660
There's no way someone like <i>me</i> could win!

00:06:08.950 --> 00:06:11.690
It's a shame to give up before you've even started!

00:06:11.690 --> 00:06:13.440
Why not just give it your best shot?

00:06:13.440 --> 00:06:18.380
But I'm a crybaby, and I'm no good at anything, and I can't take pressure.

00:06:20.090 --> 00:06:21.590
I'm sorry, Yayoi.

00:06:21.590 --> 00:06:25.080
I get the feeling we've forced you into doing something you don't want to do.

00:06:25.080 --> 00:06:26.780
I'll go tell Reika you're not doing it.

00:06:28.950 --> 00:06:30.630
Back in a second!

00:06:32.740 --> 00:06:34.260
Wait, Akane-chan!

00:06:36.150 --> 00:06:38.030
You know, Kise-san,

00:06:38.030 --> 00:06:39.750
there's something I read in a book once.

00:06:39.750 --> 00:06:41.930
Pictures are mirrors that reflect the heart.

00:06:42.290 --> 00:06:43.470
What do you mean?

00:06:43.840 --> 00:06:47.370
Maybe it's true that you're a bit of a crybaby,

00:06:47.370 --> 00:06:50.010
but you're really kind and considerate,

00:06:50.010 --> 00:06:54.030
and I think that's how you can draw such cool heroes.

00:06:54.030 --> 00:06:56.110
It's just like she says.

00:06:57.150 --> 00:06:59.080
I don't know how things will turn out,

00:06:59.260 --> 00:07:02.050
but if you feel even just a little bit like giving it a go…

00:07:08.900 --> 00:07:10.300
I want…

00:07:10.300 --> 00:07:11.190
…to give it a try.

00:07:12.770 --> 00:07:14.160
Alright!

00:07:14.330 --> 00:07:15.820
If that's the way you feel...

00:07:15.820 --> 00:07:17.130
...We'll help you out!

00:07:19.360 --> 00:07:21.600
Thanks, guys.

00:07:22.890 --> 00:07:24.970
You really are a crybaby, aren't you?

00:07:25.310 --> 00:07:27.140
Make a peace sign with your right hand.

00:07:27.940 --> 00:07:29.810
Move your foot forward a little.

00:07:30.410 --> 00:07:33.090
Turn your body to the right.

00:07:33.090 --> 00:07:34.380
Stay like that!

00:07:43.780 --> 00:07:44.860
Miyuki!

00:07:44.860 --> 00:07:46.700
Look for the third Precure-kuru!

00:07:48.230 --> 00:07:49.730
Candy! Stay in there!

00:07:50.780 --> 00:07:52.170
What's that piglet?

00:07:52.330 --> 00:07:54.990
I'm no piglet-kuru!

00:07:54.990 --> 00:07:56.520
Whaf do ya fink—

00:07:56.520 --> 00:07:58.970
This here, um, is Candy, you see…

00:07:58.970 --> 00:08:00.340
Candy?

00:08:00.340 --> 00:08:01.680
Alright!

00:08:01.680 --> 00:08:03.670
I'll draw Candy, too!

00:08:06.320 --> 00:08:08.330
I'm so happy-kuru!

00:08:10.420 --> 00:08:11.290
I'm back!

00:08:12.360 --> 00:08:14.260
I got some food!

00:08:15.410 --> 00:08:17.090
That looks delicious!

00:08:18.900 --> 00:08:21.370
But why did you bring okonomiyaki?

00:08:21.370 --> 00:08:24.170
My family runs an okonomiyaki shop!

00:08:25.750 --> 00:08:27.560
Time to dig in!

00:08:31.120 --> 00:08:33.460
Lift your right hand a little higher.

00:08:33.460 --> 00:08:34.450
Like this?

00:08:34.450 --> 00:08:35.310
Ow! Ow!

00:08:35.570 --> 00:08:37.880
Not that high!

00:08:38.580 --> 00:08:39.780
Ow! Ow!

00:09:01.540 --> 00:09:03.740
It's finished!

00:09:09.550 --> 00:09:10.800
That's our Kise-san!

00:09:10.800 --> 00:09:12.350
That's amazing!

00:09:12.350 --> 00:09:13.550
It's all thanks to your help.

00:09:13.850 --> 00:09:17.080
You know, there's something you made me realize.

00:09:17.080 --> 00:09:20.170
I keep running away from things.

00:09:20.170 --> 00:09:23.410
To tell the truth, I did want to draw this poster.

00:09:23.410 --> 00:09:24.630
I just couldn't say it.

00:09:24.870 --> 00:09:26.260
That's okay!

00:09:26.260 --> 00:09:28.640
You saw it through to the end, didn't you?

00:09:28.640 --> 00:09:31.600
That's right! I think you're pretty cool right now.

00:09:34.050 --> 00:09:35.570
Thanks!

00:09:46.270 --> 00:09:49.590
I smell a warm friendship around here-oni.

00:09:50.150 --> 00:09:54.630
I will give it a Bad End-oni!

00:10:00.330 --> 00:10:01.660
Peace!

00:10:07.420 --> 00:10:08.770
Candy!

00:10:10.040 --> 00:10:13.870
Good morning!

00:10:16.030 --> 00:10:18.510
Akane-chan! Good morning!

00:10:18.510 --> 00:10:19.820
Hey, Miyuki!

00:10:19.820 --> 00:10:22.210
I hear Yayoi's poster is up on display!

00:10:22.210 --> 00:10:23.150
Really?

00:10:23.150 --> 00:10:24.580
Let's go! Let's go!

00:10:29.640 --> 00:10:31.220
Hey, Kise-san!

00:10:31.640 --> 00:10:32.730
How'd it go?

00:10:41.170 --> 00:10:42.530
Honorable mention?

00:10:43.120 --> 00:10:45.610
You two worked so hard to help me out.

00:10:45.610 --> 00:10:46.740
I'm sorry.

00:10:46.740 --> 00:10:49.490
No, I think getting an honorable mention is great!

00:10:49.490 --> 00:10:50.310
That's right!

00:10:50.310 --> 00:10:53.320
Your poster looks like the real star of the show to me.

00:10:53.320 --> 00:10:54.050
Yeah!

00:10:54.050 --> 00:10:56.010
Thanks, guys.

00:10:56.010 --> 00:10:58.260
You just can't take losing.

00:10:59.220 --> 00:11:03.990
Anyone would say that President Sago's poster is by far the most artistic.

00:11:04.330 --> 00:11:07.960
That joke of a poster just doesn't compare.

00:11:09.480 --> 00:11:11.220
Hey, what's up with you guys?

00:11:11.220 --> 00:11:12.260
Yeah!

00:11:12.260 --> 00:11:14.350
Kise-san did her best in making that poster!

00:11:14.350 --> 00:11:15.950
Stop it, you two.

00:11:15.950 --> 00:11:16.670
It doesn't matter.

00:11:18.490 --> 00:11:19.100
Kise-san!

00:11:19.100 --> 00:11:21.270
Yayoi! Where are you going?

00:11:23.390 --> 00:11:25.480
It's some crying kid-oni.

00:11:25.480 --> 00:11:29.550
I'll give her an even <i>worse</i> Bad End-oni!

00:11:30.110 --> 00:11:31.110
I knew it…

00:11:31.110 --> 00:11:32.820
My pictures suck.

00:11:36.070 --> 00:11:37.160
Crybaby!

00:11:37.160 --> 00:11:38.380
Wimp!

00:11:38.380 --> 00:11:39.150
Who's that?

00:11:39.150 --> 00:11:41.430
No matter how hard you try, you're no good!

00:11:42.280 --> 00:11:44.350
I know that already!

00:11:44.360 --> 00:11:46.800
But I still like drawing pictures.

00:11:47.980 --> 00:11:48.930
The world!

00:11:49.200 --> 00:11:53.470
Be stained with the worst possible ending: a Bad End-oni!

00:11:54.040 --> 00:11:56.710
I'll blot out the pages where your future will be written-oni!

00:12:02.850 --> 00:12:04.050
It's all over.

00:12:04.050 --> 00:12:05.450
I've lost all my hopes and dreams.

00:12:06.520 --> 00:12:08.950
I… should just give up drawing…

00:12:10.220 --> 00:12:12.940
The Bad Energy from these humans

00:12:12.940 --> 00:12:14.980
is bringing back our lord Pierrot-sama,

00:12:14.980 --> 00:12:17.680
the Emperor of Evil-oni!

00:12:22.300 --> 00:12:23.800
Kise-san!

00:12:25.180 --> 00:12:26.280
What's that?

00:12:27.370 --> 00:12:28.640
What is it?

00:12:29.720 --> 00:12:30.510
Huh?

00:12:30.510 --> 00:12:31.540
It's not the wolf!

00:12:31.770 --> 00:12:35.250
I'll stain you with Bad End, as well-oni!

00:12:37.120 --> 00:12:39.150
Kuru! It's Akaoni-kuru!

00:12:39.530 --> 00:12:40.590
Akaoni-san?!

00:12:40.590 --> 00:12:41.810
I'm Akaoni!

00:12:41.820 --> 00:12:42.720
Oni! Oni!

00:12:45.610 --> 00:12:46.990
Kuru!

00:12:50.740 --> 00:12:52.360
“Cleanpeace Man”?

00:12:52.360 --> 00:12:54.770
How pathetic-oni!

00:12:57.010 --> 00:12:58.250
What did you say?

00:12:58.250 --> 00:13:01.340
That poster is the fruit of Yayoi's hard labor!

00:13:01.340 --> 00:13:02.630
You're talking about hard work?

00:13:02.630 --> 00:13:04.540
In that case, I'll crush it-oni!

00:13:04.920 --> 00:13:06.280
Kuru!

00:13:06.280 --> 00:13:08.740
Come out, Akanbe!

00:13:12.750 --> 00:13:14.920
Akanbe!

00:13:14.920 --> 00:13:17.120
Miyuki, Akane! Transform-kuru!

00:13:18.300 --> 00:13:20.750
How could you do that to Kise-san's poster?

00:13:20.750 --> 00:13:21.690
You won't get away with this!

00:13:21.690 --> 00:13:22.410
That's right!

00:13:22.410 --> 00:13:24.600
We'll knock you out in one hit!

00:13:28.310 --> 00:13:29.570
Ready?

00:13:30.420 --> 00:13:32.880
Precure Smile Charge!

00:13:32.880 --> 00:13:33.520
Go!

00:13:34.940 --> 00:13:36.710
Go! Go!

00:13:36.710 --> 00:13:38.010
Let's go!

00:14:18.380 --> 00:14:20.250
The light of the future,

00:14:20.250 --> 00:14:21.740
shining bright!

00:14:23.310 --> 00:14:24.900
Cure Happy!

00:14:27.850 --> 00:14:29.940
Dazzling sun!

00:14:29.940 --> 00:14:31.830
Hot-blooded power!

00:14:32.440 --> 00:14:34.310
Cure Sunny!

00:14:38.240 --> 00:14:40.130
You brats are Precure, eh?

00:14:40.130 --> 00:14:41.710
We'll squish you-oni!

00:14:42.060 --> 00:14:43.310
Go, Akanbe!

00:14:43.740 --> 00:14:45.620
Akanbe!

00:14:49.370 --> 00:14:51.220
Akanbe!

00:14:53.490 --> 00:14:54.510
He's tough!

00:14:54.510 --> 00:14:56.590
I've had enough!

00:14:56.590 --> 00:14:58.260
Alright! Me too!

00:14:59.110 --> 00:15:00.730
Spirit! Spirit!

00:15:04.840 --> 00:15:06.100
Precure!

00:15:07.890 --> 00:15:09.930
Happy…

00:15:09.950 --> 00:15:10.800
Akan—!

00:15:10.800 --> 00:15:12.650
…Shower!

00:15:14.510 --> 00:15:15.430
—be!

00:15:17.120 --> 00:15:19.850
But I put everything into that!

00:15:20.470 --> 00:15:21.410
Happy!

00:15:22.380 --> 00:15:23.820
What an idiot-oni!

00:15:25.480 --> 00:15:27.010
If Happy's attack didn't work,

00:15:27.010 --> 00:15:28.320
I'll have to do it!

00:15:30.850 --> 00:15:32.850
Precure!

00:15:34.620 --> 00:15:35.730
Sunny…

00:15:35.730 --> 00:15:37.900
…Fire!

00:15:43.580 --> 00:15:44.340
What the?

00:15:44.500 --> 00:15:47.070
You didn't put enough power into it-kuru!

00:15:47.310 --> 00:15:48.360
No way!

00:15:48.360 --> 00:15:51.210
Damn! That attack wears me out!

00:15:52.630 --> 00:15:54.880
<i>Akanbe!</i>

00:15:58.250 --> 00:15:59.950
Happy! Sunny!

00:16:03.190 --> 00:16:06.230
There's no point in weaklings like you even trying-oni!

00:16:07.330 --> 00:16:08.690
I still don't know…

00:16:09.370 --> 00:16:11.160
…if it's pointless or not.

00:16:11.780 --> 00:16:15.270
How could you make fun of the picture Kise-san put so much effort into?

00:16:15.270 --> 00:16:16.340
You won't get away with this!

00:16:20.510 --> 00:16:21.370
What's going on?

00:16:22.170 --> 00:16:22.840
Kise-san!

00:16:23.620 --> 00:16:24.720
That voice…

00:16:24.720 --> 00:16:26.080
Is that <i>you,</i> Hoshizora-san?

00:16:26.940 --> 00:16:29.030
Sorry, I can't tell you that!

00:16:29.030 --> 00:16:32.080
Saying it like that just makes it obvious!

00:16:32.080 --> 00:16:32.790
You're right!

00:16:34.190 --> 00:16:36.520
Akanbe!

00:16:37.260 --> 00:16:37.990
What?

00:16:37.990 --> 00:16:39.020
Akanbe!

00:16:44.120 --> 00:16:46.780
You're not laying a finger on Kise-san!

00:16:46.780 --> 00:16:48.190
Hoshizora-san!

00:16:48.870 --> 00:16:51.770
<i>Akan—!</i>

00:16:53.180 --> 00:16:54.290
<i>—be!</i>

00:16:56.080 --> 00:16:57.280
Akanbe!

00:17:05.860 --> 00:17:07.220
Now, Akanbe!

00:17:07.220 --> 00:17:08.290
Finish them-oni!

00:17:09.710 --> 00:17:13.160
Akanbe!

00:17:25.800 --> 00:17:27.560
I'm scared! I'm scared! I'm scared!

00:17:27.560 --> 00:17:28.390
But…

00:17:35.900 --> 00:17:37.580
Those two are…

00:17:37.580 --> 00:17:39.180
Those two are my special…

00:17:43.520 --> 00:17:44.720
Kise-san!

00:17:44.720 --> 00:17:46.340
What do you think <i>you're</i> doing?

00:17:46.340 --> 00:17:48.190
Wimps like you should keep out of this-oni.

00:17:48.680 --> 00:17:50.480
I may be a wimp,

00:17:50.480 --> 00:17:52.340
and I may cry a lot,

00:17:52.340 --> 00:17:55.220
but those two gave me courage.

00:17:55.220 --> 00:17:57.130
They're my special friends!

00:17:57.130 --> 00:17:58.010
Kise-san!

00:17:58.010 --> 00:17:58.980
Yayoi!

00:17:58.980 --> 00:18:01.170
How could you hurt them?

00:18:01.170 --> 00:18:02.910
You won't get away with this!

00:18:06.940 --> 00:18:07.710
Is that…?!

00:18:13.110 --> 00:18:14.390
What's this?

00:18:14.390 --> 00:18:16.310
A Smile Pact-kuru!

00:18:16.310 --> 00:18:17.380
Candy?

00:18:17.380 --> 00:18:19.090
Wait, so you're not a toy?

00:18:19.090 --> 00:18:20.830
Never mind about that!{But stay tuned in for the commercials to see how you can take home a toy me :P}

00:18:20.830 --> 00:18:23.910
Hurry up and put a Cure Décor into the Smile Pact,

00:18:23.910 --> 00:18:26.500
and cry “Precure Smile Charge!”-kuru!

00:18:26.680 --> 00:18:28.700
I don't really understand, but I'll give it a try!{TL: phew. I almost thought they weren't going to say it this episode ._.'}

00:18:32.410 --> 00:18:33.580
Ready?

00:18:34.570 --> 00:18:37.000
Precure Smile Charge!

00:18:37.000 --> 00:18:38.040
Go!

00:18:39.040 --> 00:18:40.780
Go! Go!

00:18:40.790 --> 00:18:42.610
Let's go, Peace!

00:19:06.040 --> 00:19:09.490
Rock, paper, scissors! Sparkling bright...{Timer: Pretty sure that was supposed to be: Pika-Pika-Pikachu!}{TL: o_O}

00:19:11.010 --> 00:19:12.490
Cure Peace!

00:19:15.110 --> 00:19:17.430
Cure Peace? So cute!

00:19:17.430 --> 00:19:18.530
“Rock, paper, scissors”?

00:19:18.530 --> 00:19:19.350
What the heck?

00:19:19.720 --> 00:19:21.820
What? A <i>third</i> Precure?

00:19:22.030 --> 00:19:23.820
Is this… me?

00:19:23.820 --> 00:19:25.060
Amazing!

00:19:25.060 --> 00:19:26.790
I'm like a real super hero!

00:19:27.000 --> 00:19:29.260
Akanbe!

00:19:33.050 --> 00:19:35.300
Akanbe!

00:19:43.370 --> 00:19:45.010
Don't run away!

00:19:45.010 --> 00:19:47.210
Precure are legendary warriors-kuru!

00:19:47.210 --> 00:19:49.920
Even if you say so, I'm still scared!

00:19:49.920 --> 00:19:51.820
Akanbe!

00:19:55.750 --> 00:19:57.220
Akanbe!

00:20:03.800 --> 00:20:04.630
Akan—

00:20:06.600 --> 00:20:08.200
What happened-oni?!

00:20:08.390 --> 00:20:10.830
Cure Peace's cleansing power…

00:20:10.830 --> 00:20:11.900
…is thunder-kuru!

00:20:12.240 --> 00:20:13.470
Thunder?

00:20:13.470 --> 00:20:16.300
Put your spirit into the Smile Pact-kuru!

00:20:16.830 --> 00:20:17.910
You mean this?

00:20:17.910 --> 00:20:19.220
Yeah!

00:20:19.220 --> 00:20:20.250
Alright!

00:20:27.070 --> 00:20:28.090
Precure!

00:20:30.520 --> 00:20:32.500
Peace…

00:20:32.500 --> 00:20:34.460
…Thunder!

00:20:39.870 --> 00:20:41.670
Akanbe!

00:20:49.640 --> 00:20:51.280
You did it-kuru!

00:20:54.550 --> 00:20:55.520
Precure!

00:20:55.520 --> 00:20:57.950
I won't go easy on you next time-oni!

00:21:01.890 --> 00:21:03.920
It's a new Cure Décor-kuru!

00:21:05.520 --> 00:21:06.890
What a shock!

00:21:06.890 --> 00:21:09.260
Did I really just transform?

00:21:09.260 --> 00:21:09.960
That's right!

00:21:09.960 --> 00:21:12.260
From now on, you're one of us!

00:21:12.550 --> 00:21:14.260
We'll need your help!

00:21:14.260 --> 00:21:15.420
Me…?

00:21:15.420 --> 00:21:18.000
A legendary warrior? A Precure?

00:21:19.090 --> 00:21:20.160
I'll do it!

00:21:21.600 --> 00:21:23.930
I've always loved them, you know!

00:21:23.930 --> 00:21:26.650
Super heroes who defend the world!

00:21:26.650 --> 00:21:30.120
Now there are three Precure-kuru! I'm so happy-kuru!

00:21:30.630 --> 00:21:31.820
I'm sorry, Kise-san.

00:21:32.120 --> 00:21:35.790
That poster you worked so hard on is all crumpled up.

00:21:36.750 --> 00:21:37.870
That's okay.

00:21:38.730 --> 00:21:42.090
Being with you guys has made me realize.

00:21:42.090 --> 00:21:44.540
What I really want is courage and…

00:21:44.540 --> 00:21:45.860
…um…

00:21:48.680 --> 00:21:50.670
…um, Hoshizora-san?

00:21:50.670 --> 00:21:51.600
What?

00:21:51.600 --> 00:21:54.310
Is… Is it okay if I call you Miyuki-chan…?

00:21:55.440 --> 00:21:56.850
Of course it is,

00:21:56.850 --> 00:21:57.880
Yayoi-chan!

00:22:00.100 --> 00:22:02.580
Let's be good friends, Miyuki-chan!

00:22:03.000 --> 00:22:05.220
What are you crying about?

00:22:05.220 --> 00:22:06.810
I'm not crying!

00:22:22.770 --> 00:22:24.680
With you — Yay! Yay! Yay! Yay!

00:22:24.680 --> 00:22:28.520
Smile, brushing your tears aside.

00:22:28.650 --> 00:22:30.570
Always — Yay! Yay! Yay!

00:22:30.570 --> 00:22:33.900
Let's race for tomorrow, spirits high.

00:22:35.070 --> 00:22:40.410
Ever excited, hearts pounding, Precure!

00:22:40.830 --> 00:22:43.830
You're not alone! If you look beside you

00:22:43.830 --> 00:22:45.910
The world is sparkling.

00:22:46.710 --> 00:22:49.840
The sun in the sky is telling you

00:22:49.840 --> 00:22:51.710
Hallelujah to tomorrow.

00:22:52.920 --> 00:22:55.970
What matters more than anything

00:22:55.970 --> 00:22:58.180
(Wow! What matters)

00:22:58.180 --> 00:22:58.640
(Wow! What matters)

00:22:58.720 --> 00:23:01.300
Is that we believe in one another.

00:23:01.300 --> 00:23:02.510
Is that we believe in one another.

00:23:02.640 --> 00:23:03.680
(Yay!)

00:23:03.770 --> 00:23:05.680
That's right — Yay! Yay! Yay! Yay!

00:23:05.680 --> 00:23:09.650
Pose, make a peace sign and, with a “Say cheese!”, smile.

00:23:09.650 --> 00:23:11.570
Always — Yay! Yay! Yay!

00:23:11.570 --> 00:23:14.860
Before you know it, we're all here together.

00:23:15.400 --> 00:23:17.450
Again — Yay! Yay! Yay! Yay!

00:23:17.450 --> 00:23:21.280
All together, to the sky, to tomorrow, full of hope.

00:23:21.280 --> 00:23:23.290
Let's go — Yay! Yay! Yay!

00:23:23.290 --> 00:23:26.660
Smile, on the way to a bright future.

00:23:27.790 --> 00:23:33.210
Ever excited, hearts pounding, Precure!

00:23:33.300 --> 00:23:36.340
Smile! Precure!

00:23:44.210 --> 00:23:45.920
She can't stand injustice,

00:23:45.920 --> 00:23:48.480
is soft-hearted and has a strong sense of duty: Midorikawa-san!

00:23:48.480 --> 00:23:49.360
Hoshizora-san?

00:23:49.360 --> 00:23:50.390
What's all this about?

00:23:50.390 --> 00:23:52.930
A caring big sister-kuru!

00:23:52.930 --> 00:23:53.790
It talked!

00:23:54.020 --> 00:23:56.230
What's this plushie? It's cute!

00:23:56.230 --> 00:23:57.100
That's it!

00:23:57.100 --> 00:23:59.830
Midorikawa-san, let's be Precure together, okay?

00:23:59.830 --> 00:24:01.000
“Precure”?

00:24:01.000 --> 00:24:03.240
What are you talking about?

00:24:03.240 --> 00:24:04.640
Smile Precure!

00:24:07.370 --> 00:24:09.600
Find your ultra happy smile!
